{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And Yosef recognized, etc.</b> Because he left them with beards grown." "<b>But they did not recognize him.</b> Because he left them without a beard grown, and now he came with a beard grown (Ketubot 27)." "And another interpretation: <b>And Yosef recognized his brothers</b> — when they were delivered into his hand, he recognized that they were his brothers and had mercy on them; and they did not recognize him when he fell into their hands, to treat him as a brother."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:08.435048536Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}